| **Overall** | **8.4** |

Fixing the major error alone may not clear 8.5. The Enneagram score is capped by the record itself: no costly choice of hers separates Type 6 from Type 4, and the article admits the lead is narrow. So the repair probably also has to tighten the writing. The second half reads like a list of concessions, and the 168-word biography paragraph is dense.

I also added one lesson to an existing memory file: absence claims an editor adds need checking against every cited source, audio included.
